        "# kombify: Text or image to video (Wan 2.2 TI2V 5B, 16 GB VRAM)\n\nReviewed StackKits template (derived from the MIT-licensed ComfyUI workflow templates). Models are never bundled. Download the preset once, after reading its license:\n\n```\nstackkit setup ai-image-video --owner-approve\n```\n\nwith `.stackkit/setup/ai-image-video.json` = `{\"preset\":\"wan22-5b\",\"acceptLicense\":\"apache-2.0\"}`.\n\nFive seconds at 1280x704 and 24 fps. Connect a Load Image node to start_image of Wan22ImageToVideoLatent to animate a picture instead."
